# A stub of Nemo.Notifications, for linting and loading Vuo's QML on a machine
# without the SailfishOS SDK. See ../../Sailfish/Silica/qmldir for why stubs
# exist at all.
#
# `Notification` used to be declared in the Silica stub instead. Real Silica
# has no such type -- it lives here, in nemo-qml-plugin-notifications -- so a
# page that used it with only `import Sailfish.Silica 1.0` would have compiled
# against the stubs and failed to load on a phone.
module Nemo.Notifications

Notification 1.0 Notification.qml
